# Source rulebooks — commercial WotC material, not distributed with this repo.
# Obtain your own copies and place them here; see Documents/README.md.
Documents/*.pdf 
# Vector indexes are build artifacts, not source. `scripts/ingest.py` rebuilds
# chroma_db/ from corpus/srd/ in ~35s; chroma_db_full/ needs your own rulebook
# PDFs. Neither belongs in git — the store is also rewritten on every *read*,
# which used to dirty the working tree constantly (KNOWN_ISSUES #23).
chroma_db/
chroma_db_full/

# Agent interaction logs are runtime output. One 2025 sample is kept in the
# repo because three docs cite it as evidence for KNOWN_ISSUES #6.
logs/llm_interactions/*.jsonl
!logs/llm_interactions/llm_log_2025-03-31.jsonl
